  {# An honest empty state, not a chart of made-up numbers.

     GoatCounter's statistics API needs a token. A token in this page would be readable by
     anyone who opened the source, and the app's CSP deliberately refuses to let anything behind
     the login talk to a host it has no reason to talk to - so the route in is the API, which
     already holds secrets properly and is already on the connect-src allowlist.

     Written out rather than left as a "coming soon", because the next person to open this page
     will be deciding whether to build it, and this is what they need to know. #}
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-text">Not connected yet</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mt-2 max-w-prose">
      Analytics are collected — GoatCounter has been counting consented visits to
      tzortzoglou.eu all along, and nothing here changes what is gathered or how. What is
      missing is a way to read them back into this page.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-6 font-semibold text-brand-text">What it needs</h3>
    <ol class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-brand-muted list-decimal pl-5 max-w-prose">
      <li>A GoatCounter API token, stored as a secret on the API host — never in this page.</li>
      <li>
        An endpoint on <code class="text-brand-text">api.tzortzoglou.eu</code>, admin-gated like
        every other one, that calls GoatCounter and returns the counts.
      </li>
      <li>This page, drawing them.</li>
    </ol>

    <h3 class="mt-6 font-semibold text-brand-text">What it will show</h3>
    <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-brand-muted list-disc pl-5 max-w-prose">
      <li>Visits over the last 30 days, and how that compares with the 30 before it.</li>
      <li>Which pages are read, which is the only honest measure of whether the writing lands.</li>
      <li>Where readers came from — and specifically, how many arrive from LinkedIn.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="hint mt-6">
      Until then the full picture lives at
      <a href="https://steftzor.goatcounter.com" rel="noopener"
        class="text-brand-accent underline hover:no-underline">steftzor.goatcounter.com</a>.
    </p>
